{"title":"2001 Iran NMO (Round 3)","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The final round of the <b>2001 Iran National Mathematics Olympiad</b> was given over two days.  On each day, the contestants had four hours to solve three problems.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Iran_NMO_(Round_3)_Problems\" title=\"2001 Iran NMO (Round 3) Problems\">2001 Iran NMO (Round 3) Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Iran_NMO_(Round_3)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 Iran NMO (Round 3) Problems/Problem 1\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Iran_NMO_(Round_3)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2001 Iran NMO (Round 3) Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Iran_NMO_(Round_3)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2001 Iran NMO (Round 3) Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Iran_NMO_(Round_3)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2001 Iran NMO (Round 3) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Iran_NMO_(Round_3)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2001 Iran NMO (Round 3) Problems/Problem 5\"> Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Iran_NMO_(Round_3)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2001 Iran NMO (Round 3) Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 6</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_Iran_NMO_(Round_3)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\